S .... x... .... x... | .... x... .... x...
H x... x... x... x... | x... x... x... x...

[heavy bridge intensity=0.30-0.70]
K X..x .... X... .... | X..x .... X... ....
S .... x... .... x... | .... x... .... x...
H x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x. | x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x.

[heavy bridge intensity=0.50-0.90]
K X..x ..x. X.x. ..x. | X..x ..x. X.x. xxxx
S .... x... .... x... | .... x... .... x...
H x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x. | x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x.
C X... .... .... .... | .... .... .... ....

# ---- odd meters (hand written, tools/write_meter_grooves.py) ----
# The step counts divide the bar: 7/8 takes 7, 14, 21 ... steps; spaces are only for reading.
# Jazz /4 meters count triplets (3 steps per quarter), the others eighths.

[classic verse 7/8 intensity=0.20-0.60]
K     x.x .. .x
S     ... x. x.
H     xxx xx xx

[classic verse 7/8 intensity=0.40-0.80]
K     x.x .. .x
S     ... x. x.
H     xxx xx xx
S@0.7 .g. .g ..

[classic verse 7/8 intensity=0.60-1.00]
K     x. .x ..x
S     .. x. x..
H     xx xx xxx
S@0.6 .g .. .g.

[classic verse 5/4 intensity=0.20-0.60]
K     x. .. .x .. x.
S     .. .. .. x. ..
H     x. x. x. x. x.

[classic verse 5/4 intensity=0.40-0.80]
K     x. .x .. .x x.
S     .. .. .. x. ..
H     xx xx xx xx xx
S@0.6 .. g. .g .. .g

[classic verse 5/4 intensity=0.60-1.00]
K     x. .. .x .. .x
S     .. .. x. .. x.
H     xx xx xx xx xx
S@0.6 .g .. .. g. ..

[classic verse 3/4 intensity=0.20-0.60]
K     x. .. .x
S     .. x. ..
H     xx xx xx

[classic verse 3/4 intensity=0.40-0.80]
K     x. .x .x
S     .. x. x.
H     xx xx xx
S@0.6 .g .. g.

[classic verse 3/4 intensity=0.60-1.00]
K     xx .x .x
S     .. x. x.
H     xx xx xx
S@0.6 .g .g g.

